OL,3,GNEWSABereaved families say they won't
OL,4,Atake part in Welsh Covid-19 review
OL,5,Awithout legal powers
OL,6,
OL,7,FCampaigners for families who lost
OL,8,Frelatives to Covid-19 say they will not
OL,9,Ftake part in the Welsh government's
OL,10,Fpandemic review unless it has legal
OL,11,Fpowers.
OL,13,FRepresentatives of Covid-19 Bereaved
OL,14,FFamilies for Justice Cymru said the
OL,15,Fgroup was concerned the review would
OL,16,Fnot have the power to call people to
OL,17,Fgive evidence under oath, something
OL,18,FWales' health minister promised before
OL,19,Fentering government.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
