OL,3,GNEWSABereaved families say they won't
OL,4,Atake part in Welsh Covid-19 review
OL,5,Awithout legal powers
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Plaid Cymru government announced it
OL,8,Fwould hold an independent review of the
OL,9,Fprevious Labour administration's
OL,10,Fhandling of the pandemic, but did not
OL,11,Fgive further details of how it will
OL,12,Ftake shape.
OL,14,FReform UK Wales said anything other
OL,15,Fthan a full public inquiry would be "a
OL,16,Fspectacular U-turn" from Plaid.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
